SUMMARY:AMC Friday Ecstatic Dance w/ DJ Mikaya + Startribe
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, May 29th\nEvening Danc
 e Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nFacil
 itator: DJ Mikaya\n\nIntention: TBA\n\nAbout the DJ\nDJ Mikaya (Micah Swab
 b) is a facilitator at AMC and creator of dance waves with many styles and
  flavors within the Ecstatic Dance realm. His deejay skill has spanned ove
 r two decades covering many ecstatic dance containers\, festivals\, sound 
 healing events and yoga classes. You can listen to his catalog of over 80 
 mixes and mashups at http://soundcloud.com/mikayaswabb.\nWe're excited to 
 be dancing with StarTribe's amazing 24 speaker sound system outside in the
  park!\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance starts at Warm up
 . The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and any that come late will b
 e turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe and secure container. \\
 *\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price.\n\nNo one turned away f
 or lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\n\n[https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/.../djseigea.../](https://ashevillemovementcollective.o
 rg/.../djseigea.../?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0R
 XNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR60jGoPctQmZENEP-6g1PiLerpr4LJLC5h
 eP1Rn7TgedmIne3f6mes9kn3Wnw_aem_ASPUspeNro8PjxFCFjEUGg)\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe 
 need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Register to volunteer at:\n
 [https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](https://ashevillemove
 mentcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmF
 lam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71U
 KxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\nIMPORTA
 NT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginning of the opening circl
 e. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH WAVES!\n\nCollective ag
 reements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/](https://as
 hevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBEx
 MFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH
 1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAf
 A)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envisions a world that mov
 es in harmony where all are free to be their authentic selves within a lov
 ing community. Our mission and aim are to inspire authenticity and healthy
  community through free-form dance by hosting dance waves for personal and
  community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.\n\nL
 ocation: TBA\n\nSee you on the dance floor!
