 c spaces. Now a regular presence on Asheville’s ecstatic dance floors\, 
 she is first and foremost a lover of the dance. Magdalyn crafts sets that 
 blend conscious lyrics\, world beats\, and juicy\, booty-shaking rhythms\,
  guiding dancers through immersive journeys that celebrate connection\, tr
 ansformation\, and the pleasure of being fully moved by music. https://sou
 ndcloud.com/wrynmagdalyn\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that the dance
